{"id":"832d56b1523dc5f9","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-decidable-representable.md","title":"Decidable Implies Representable","display":"prop-decidable-representable — Decidable Implies Representable","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-decidable-representable","aliases":["92-prop-decidable-representable"],"display":"prop-decidable-representable — Decidable Implies Representable","depends_on":["[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-decidable-set]]","[[92-df-representable]]","[[92-thm-representability]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-decidable-representable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-decidable-representable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-decidable-representable — Decidable Implies Representable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0b2170bf5b3075ce\" href=\"?note=0b2170bf5b3075ce\" title=\"92-thm-representability\">92-thm-representability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\)</span> (decidable, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength assumption, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> (representability predicate in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>可判定 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可表示 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a>)</li>\n<li>可判定集的特征函数是递归的</li>\n<li>递归函数在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可表示</li>\n<li>含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>的算术理论能逐个证明正确的成员与非成员numeral实例，因此可判定集在其中可表示</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>都是公式集；形式系统三元组<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>本身不是集合包含右端</li>\n<li>这是可表示性定理的直接应用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-decidable-set]]